**Goal Model – Multi‑Robot Resource‑Delivery Mission**

| **Name**                                           | **Text**                                                                                                | **Runtime**            | **Goal Type** | **Enquired Info / Target** | **Relation** | **Ground truth I** | **Ground truth C** | **Ground truth E** |
| -------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ------------- | -------------------------- | ------------ | ------------------ | ------------------ | ------------------ |
| G1: **Execute Resource Delivery Mission**          | Complete the end-to-end collection and delivery of requested resources.                                 | `;` (sequential)       | Perform       | –                          | AND          | OK                   |                    |                    |
| G2: **Collection Phase**                           | Collect required resources from storage locations.                                                      | `FALLBACK(G2.1, G2.2)` | Perform       | –                          | OR           | Achieve. Target condition: all resources were collected.                   |                    |                    |
| G2.1: **Normal Collection Process**                | Follow the computed order to request and retrieve resources.                                            | `;` (sequential)       | Perform       | –                          | AND          | OK                   |                    |                    |
| G2.1.1: **Determine Order of Storages**            | Compute the order of storage visits based on waiting time and path length.                              | `-`                    | Query         | Order of storages          | –            | OK                   |                    |                    |
| G2.1.2: **Send Request to Storage**                | Send a message to the storage specifying the requested resources.                                       | `-`                    | –             | –                          | –            | Query. Enqueried information: resources to be collected                  |                    |                    |
| G2.1.3: **Wait for Retrieval**                     | Wait until the storage confirms that resources have been retrieved.                                     | `-`                    | –             | –                          | –            | Perform.                   |                    |                    |
| G2.2: **Low-Battery Handling in Collection**       | If battery falls below 10 % during collection, recharge and transfer the mission.                       | `AND`                  | Perform       | –                          | AND          |  OK                  |                    |                    |
| G3: **Delivery Phase**                             | Deliver collected resources to the designated location.                                                 | `FALLBACK(G3.1, G3.2)` | Perform       | –                          | OR           |  Achieve. Target condition: all resources were delivered.                  |                    |                    |
| G3.1: **Normal Delivery Process**                  | Deliver all resources to the destination.                                                               | `-`                    | Perform       | –                          | –            |  OK                  |                    |                    |
| G3.1.1: **Deliver Resources to Destination**       | Transport resources from storage to the specified location.                                             | `-`                    | –             | –                          | –            | OK                   |                    |                    |
| G3.2: **Low-Battery Handling in Delivery**         | If battery falls below 30 % during delivery, return resource to checkpoint and delegate remaining task. | `AND`                  | Perform       | –                          | AND          | OK                   |                    |                    |
| G3.2.1: **Return Resource to Checkpoint**          | Return the resource to a checkpoint location.                                                           | `-`                    | –             | –                          | –            | Ok                   |                    |                    |
| G3.2.2: **Assign Remaining Task to Another Robot** | Assign the remaining delivery task to another robot.                                                    | `-`                    | –             | –                          | –            | OK                   |                    |                    |
| G3.2.3: **Trigger Alert**                          | If failure to return resource to checkpoint, trigger an alert and report to sector manager.             | `-`                    | –             | –                          | –            | OK                   |                    |                    |


---

### Task Model

| **Name** | **Text** | **Relation** | **Location** | **Number of Robots** |
|----------|----------|--------------|--------------|----------------------|
| AT1: **Go to Recharge Station** | Navigate to the charging station to recharge battery. | AND (with AT2) | Recharge Station | 1 |
| AT2: **Assign Mission to Another Robot** | Notify another robot to take over the mission. | AND (with AT1) | Control Center | 1 |
| AT3: **Deliver Resources to Destination** | Transport resources to the specified destination. | – | Destination | 1 |
| AT4: **Return Resource to Checkpoint** | Return the resource to a predefined checkpoint location. | AND (with AT5, AT6) | Checkpoint | 1 |
| AT5: **Assign Remaining Task to Another Robot** | Assign the remaining delivery task to another robot. | AND (with AT4, AT6) | Control Center | 1 |
| AT6: **Trigger Alert** | Trigger an alert and send report to sector manager. | – | Control Center | 1 |
| AT7: **Send Request to Storage** | Send a request message to storage specifying required resources. | – | Storage | 1 |
| AT8: **Wait for Retrieval** | Wait until storage confirms retrieval of resources. | – | Storage | 1 |

---

### Logical Relationships (Tree Structure)

```
G1 -> G2, G3  [AND][sequential]
G2 -> G2.1, G2.2  [OR][FALLBACK]
G2.1 -> G2.1.1, G2.1.2, G2.1.3  [AND][sequential]
G2.2 -> AT1, AT2  [AND][sequential]
G3 -> G3.1, G3.2  [OR][FALLBACK]
G3.1 -> G3.1.1  [AND][sequential]
G3.2 -> G3.2.1, G3.2.2, G3.2.3  [AND][sequential]
```

